      "comment": "YONDU BALE (2) is a talented type progressing through the grades and building a strong record. Jumped well when winning his last couple. Last start won Warrnambool in a handy 25.83 beating Naturally Girl. The form from his last run stacks up well. In great form and can continue his winning ways. CACKLING SUZIE (1) had the drop on the lead early on but could only manage third, beaten 6 lengths (27.98) at Horsham in a Grade 5 over 485m. Nicely placed to grab a well-deserved win. WITCH OF NOVA (3) was in the minors two back (30.52) at The Meadows but ran below best last time at Horsham, finishing 7th. Has ability and can atone. ELEVATE (6) cannot be underestimated.",
